### 生成音乐：灵感模式
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/music/generate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "generateMode": 1,
  "modelId": 1,
  "prompt": "一首关于夏日海边的轻快流行歌",
  "makeInstrumental": false
}

### 生成音乐：自定义模式
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/music/generate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "generateMode": 2,
  "modelId": 1,
  "title": "夏日海风",
  "lyric": "[Verse]\n海风吹过沙滩\n[Chorus]\n我们一起奔跑",
  "tags": "pop, female vocals",
  "makeInstrumental": false
}

### 续写音乐
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/music/extend
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "id": 1,
  "extendSeconds": 60,
  "title": "夏日海风（续）",
  "lyric": "[Verse 2]\n夕阳落在海面"
}

### 拼接音乐
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/music/concat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "id": 2
}

### 上传音乐
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/music/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary
Authorization: {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="modelId"

1
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

我的哼唱
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="demo.mp3"

< ./demo.mp3
--WebAppBoundary--

### 生成歌词
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/music/generate-lyric
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "prompt": "夏日海边"
}

### 获得【我的】音乐分页
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/music/my-page?pageNo=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

### 获得音乐广场分页
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/music/public-page?pageNo=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

### 获得音乐详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/music/get-detail?id=1
Authorization: {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

### 修改【我的】音乐
PUT {{baseUrl}}/ai/music/update-my
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "夏日海风",
  "publicStatus": true
}

### 记录播放
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/music/play?id=1
Authorization: {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

### 获得音乐分页（管理）
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/music/page?pageNo=1&pageSize=10&status=40
Authorization: {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

### 获得音乐（管理）
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/music/get?id=1
Authorization: {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
